{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"像一脚踏上小船，木板微晃，水波荡开时身体有一瞬失重（第9秒出现）；像想好的话到嘴边又沉默几秒，怕一说出口关系就变了（第13秒出现）\",\"source\":\"先写“像一个人准备对很亲近的人说一件已经想了很久的事，话还没出口，先有几秒钟沉默”，再写“也可以把开场听成一脚踏上小船”\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿先写说话前的沉默，再写踏上小船；屏幕稿按出现时间倒置了两种并列的开场感受。\"},{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"screen\":\"手不自觉握得更紧，想用力抱牢当下，又怕太用力让小船颠簸失衡\",\"source\":\"自己也许还没有意识到在害怕什么，动作已经先透露了出来。另一幅更晃荡的画面，是想用力抱紧对方、牢牢抓住当下；但你越用力，水面的颠簸就越剧烈，船舱内的平衡就越脆弱。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿没有明确说他害怕的是用力导致失衡，屏幕稿把原本未明确的害怕具体化成了对这一后果的担忧。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"像多年后重回旧屋，家具没变知道的事却太多，温柔有了新重量（第14秒出现）\",\"source\":\"家具可能没变，可你知道的事情已经太多了。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿对家具是否改变保留了可能性，屏幕稿将其写成了确定事实。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"像多年后重回旧屋……（第14秒出现）；像夕阳沉入地平线前烧得血红金亮……（第20秒出现）\",\"source\":\"先写“这份灿烂也可能让人不太舒坦”，再写“这次重逢，也像多年后重新走进一间旧房子”。\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿先呈现夕阳般的压迫感，再呈现旧屋重逢的比喻；屏幕稿将两种并列的感受调换了先后顺序。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7af35390-9740-4513-8443-2098fa361daf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T222959148219Z", "elapsed_seconds": 349.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T22:35:48.251817+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4fa1a21c5215f808f1ca7a44b506658a5708d36365164ddcc3d90826ef28a0cd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T222959148219Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "cc6685fda8451a09a368f8a6271a94140401589526246fcd70ad43e94064342e"}}}
